\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The integrity of the product.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/The_integrity_of_the_product..png/revision/latest?cb=20211105153115\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The integrity of the product.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/The_integrity_of_the_product..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211105153115\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/The_integrity_of_the_product..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211105153115 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/The_integrity_of_the_product..png/revision/latest?cb=20211105153115 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The integrity of the product.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_integrity_of_the_product..png\" data-image-name=\"The integrity of the product..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_chair_in_a_sweet.\" title=\"A chair in a sweet.\">A chair in a sweet.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.\" title=\"A couple of Ethels.\">A couple of Ethels.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The integrity of the product.</b></i> was the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">Series 12</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 4 November 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"The integrity of the product\" was the reason <a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</a> gave when asked why she was putting the snakes back into the can, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_and_perform_a_30_second_jingle\" title=\"Write and perform a 30 second jingle\">Write and perform a 30 second jingle</a> task. The title card is of a fork embedding itself in a crabstick, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\">Desiree's</a> item chosen in the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_and_perform_a_30_second_jingle\" title=\"Write and perform a 30 second jingle\">Write and perform a 30 second jingle</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Produktets integritet', which translates as 'The integrity of the product'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Tuotteen eheys', which translates as 'Integrity of the product'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Snooker, rör och snokar i rör', which translates as 'Snooker, pipes, and snakes in pipes'. The title is referencing the snooker balls in the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_up_a_shelf_for_all_the_Taskmaster%27s_snooker_balls\" title=\"Put up a shelf for all the Taskmaster&#39;s snooker balls\">Put up a shelf for all the Taskmaster's snooker balls</a> task, the pipe in the <a href=\"/wiki/Either_get_the_pipe_through_the_box_and_everything_in_it_then_get_the_box_and_everything_in_it_through_the_pipe_or_vice_versa\" title=\"Either get the pipe through the box and everything in it then get the box and everything in it through the pipe or vice versa\">Either get the pipe through the box and everything in it then get the box and everything in it through the pipe or vice versa</a> task, and the small canned snakes in the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_and_perform_a_30_second_jingle\" title=\"Write and perform a 30 second jingle\">Write and perform a 30 second jingle</a> task. The word 'snok' is normally used to refer to a small type of snake typically found in bushes (the word used for snakes more generally is 'orm').</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Produktets integritet', which translates as 'The integrity of the product'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alan Davies</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Desiree Burch</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Guz Khan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Morgana Robinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_ridiculous_thin_thing\" title=\"Most ridiculous thin thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most ridiculous thin thing.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_up_a_shelf_for_all_the_Taskmaster%27s_snooker_balls\" title=\"Put up a shelf for all the Taskmaster&#39;s snooker balls\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put up a shelf for all the Taskmaster's snooker balls. All the Taskmaster's snooker balls must be at the Taskmaster's eyeline. Only the Taskmaster's snooker balls may be on the finished shelf. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Write_and_perform_a_30_second_jingle\" title=\"Write and perform a 30 second jingle\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Write and perform a 30-second jingle. You must reach into the barrel to find the subject of your jingle, then pop a balloon to discover the instrument that you must play under your jingle.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Either_get_the_pipe_through_the_box_and_everything_in_it_then_get_the_box_and_everything_in_it_through_the_pipe_or_vice_versa\" title=\"Either get the pipe through the box and everything in it then get the box and everything in it through the pipe or vice versa\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Either get the pipe through the box and everything in it then get the box and everything in it through the pipe or get the box and everything in it through the pipe then get the pipe through the box and everything in it. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Each_person_must_direct_their_fellow_contestants_to_draw_an_image\" title=\"Each person must direct their fellow contestants to draw an image\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Each person must direct their fellow contestants to draw an image. The drawing director may only use the following words: line, circle, square, big, small, up, down, left, right, middle, please, bendy. At the end of one minute, the drawers must write down what they think the image is. The drawers will receive one point per correct guess. The drawing director will also receive one point per correct guess. Most points overall wins.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>18</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/integrity-product\"><i>The integrity of the product.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a 